    "busy.value.vo" : {
      "comment" : "handoff 7 copy-contracts, handoff7.vo.busy.value: the busy primary button's accessibility value while its request is on its way, its label unchanged (PrimaryButton); never a visible word, so the indicator is hidden from VoiceOver and this is the only 'In progress' it finds",
